        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF161 adds support for the <code class="notranslate">match-parent</code> value of <code class="notranslate">quotes</code> in Nightly in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1752382" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1752382</a></p>
