<li>Adds it to the Firefox 161 experimental web features release notes.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">The <code class="notranslate">quotes#match-parent</code> links go to the value added in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6438779996" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46561" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/46561/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46561">#46561</a>.</p>
