    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[FF161 quotes: match-parent docs]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46561</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46561"/>
        <updated>2026-11-17T06:24:44.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF161 adds support for the <code class="notranslate">match-parent</code> value of <code class="notranslate">quotes</code> in Nightly in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1752382" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1752382</a></p>
<p dir="auto">This adds <code class="notranslate">match-parent</code> to the <code class="notranslate">quotes</code> page: the syntax, a value definition, and an example comparing <code class="notranslate">auto</code> and <code class="notranslate">match-parent</code> for nested quotes in different languages, with and without custom quotation marks.</p>
<p dir="auto">The spec still calls this value <code class="notranslate">bikeshed-this</code>. The CSSWG resolved to name it <code class="notranslate">match-parent</code> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="687390650" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5478" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5478/hovercard?comment_id=6496640997&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5478#issuecomment-6496640997">w3c/csswg-drafts#5478 (comment)</a>, but the spec hasn't been updated yet, so the formal syntax shows <code class="notranslate">bikeshed-this</code> for now.</p>
<p dir="auto">BCD in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6437584376" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/31166" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31166/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31166">mdn/browser-compat-data#31166</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6311652878" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46460" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/46460/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46460">#46460</a></p>]]></content>
